erver",[303,373],{"id":374},"verify-webhooks-before-granting-access",[303,376],{"id":377},"before-you-connect",[303,379],{"id":380},"test-before-publishing",[303,382],{"id":383},"documentation-for-your-agent",[307,385,387],{"id":386},"connecting-another-app","Connecting another app?",[297,389,390,391,393],{},"Start with ",[336,392,26],{"href":27}," to understand what Vatly handles, what your app needs, and what to ask your developer or agent to build. It also helps you choose a fluent package, SDK, or direct API approach.",[297,395,396,397,399,400,403,404,407],{},"If you are ready for your first API request, follow the ",[336,398,14],{"href":15},". Implementation examples live in the ",[336,401,402],{"href":117},"package docs",", with exact endpoint and field details in the ",[336,405,406],{"href":64},"API reference",".",{"title":409,"searchDepth":410,"depth":410,"links":411},"",2,[412,413],{"id":309,"depth":410,"text":310},{"id":386,"depth":410,"text":387},"Find platform-specific guides for using Vatly as merchant of record. Connect your Lovable or Bolt app and take the next step toward your first test purchase.","md",null,{},true,{"title":277,"description":414},"G2q772gpJbDReTWsidVhPQCkbUvnizVLaRz9hYicurk",[422,424],{"title":58,"path":274,"stem":275,"description":423,"children":-1},"Vatly JavaScript packages - Testing",{"title":284,"path":285,"stem":286,"description":425,"children":-1},"Sell European software and digital products from Lovable with Vatly handling tax and invoicing. Start with a test API key and a copy-paste integration prompt.",1794486943720]